The adapted material is the Shopify-to-WooCommerce product mapping: the compare-at price / price to
regular / sale price rule, and the mapping of Shopify product options to WooCommerce variation
attributes (src/Mapping/ProductMapper.php, which carries the notice). It is used under GPL-3.0, which
GPL-2.0-or-later permits, and combined into this work under section 13 of the GNU GPL v3 / AGPL v3. The
adapted logic was rewritten for the GraphQL Admin API, exact decimal arithmetic and a pure mapping layer.
